_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "784018deb999e6aa642863a79e71b4389410044930818a6f5853d699704ee0d4", "role": "user", "sequence": 4}, {"character_range": [0, 964], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "c73fa5a808c4811329638aae91b2631ebb7730a0d17f43064c911aa430bfd664", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}, {"character_range": [0, 128], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "0513fe22cb4cfe5932f4dfb5e3e06d58154a9ed6eed9a76f5e749a1c8dca7cd3", "role": "user", "sequence": 10}, {"character_range": [0, 839], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "5d7a6990fe4d3452cfb6334179fe9ba62e0143e1f9521022b30400a5cc307019", "role": "user", "sequence": 13}, {"character_range": [0, 94], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "2fd92a2c33df4bfbcb77cd32da678aaff8cb1e81f04bf40fe8045dcfcdabc9ef", "role": "user", "sequence": 16}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "http://127.0.0.1:8765/open/GS-759 这道题我不知道从何下手。通过它的对称性质：\n\n我先看 y/(x² + 4y²) dx 这一部分，因为是对称的，所以这部分应该等于 0；再看 -x/(x² + 4y²) dy 这一部分，也是对称等于 0。\n\n把这两个去掉之后，我们又发现 ∂Q/∂x = ∂P/∂y，基于这个积分与路径无关，那我就令 x² + 4y² = σ 把它提出来。\n\n这就变成了 1/σ 乘上积分区域（x² + 4y² ≤ σ），算 [x · e^{(x² + 4y²)} dx + 4y · e^{(x² + 4y²)} dy]。此时 ∂Q/∂x 和 ∂P/∂y 又是相等的，那我用格林公式算 ∂Q/∂x - ∂P/∂y，结果就等于 0 了。\n\n答案算出来等于 0 肯定是不对的，我这里到底哪里算错了\n"}